̡͉̹̪̣̺͉̱̱̬͎̲̦͕̞͚̗͙̳̩̺̘̞̼̟̤͚̪͕̫͈̬̖̙̩̞̳̲̟̪̙̜͜ ̷̧̢̡̡̧̧̧̨̢̨̧̡̛̛̭̫̥̞̠̫̜̺̗̝̭̗͈͓̦̜̞̻̮̪̫̥̖̺̘̝̝̲̦̼̘͍̫̟͕̦̱̟̦͎̰̯̥̹̠̦͍̲͕̟̜̼͚̯̥̣̲̜̼͈̹̼̭̲̤̯̳̺̈̃̂̇͐̏̋̅̌̆̐̀́́͛͆̏͑̂̆̽̓̓͂͘͜͜͜͝ͅh̶̢̡̨̧̡̧̧̡̧̡̡̦̹̬̥͎̮͙͖̼͖̯͚̥̙̠̳̼̳̦̦̱͖̘͍̰̤̘͖̟͔̰̗̰̫͓̠͈͔͓̣͚̯͎͖͙͍̺̞͓͈̟̞͓̜̥̞̯͙̞̱̰̗̣̲̻͕̣̫̳̤̳͕̲̘̟͍̖̭͇͚̠̪̠͙̝̖͔̰̟͙̜͍̳̙̜̣͎̙͇̳͉͈̻̲̤̟̆̑͋͊̽͌͂̓̓̽͋̂̊̇̂̑̀̂͗͂̂̽͗͗̐̐̈́͌͂͋͋̈́̾̈́͒̈̐̈́̈́͗̔̽͊͒̃̓́̏̃̆̀̓̄̊̃̌̀͋͌̓̏̌̀͆̍̊̅̓́̆̅̿͋̊̃̌̄͋͂̀͘͘͘̚̚͜͜͜͝͝͝͝͝͝͝͝͝ͅͅớ̷̡̡̧̢̧̡̢̻̞͚͍̳̯̱̥̙̻̘̻̮̝̪̲̞͎̬̖̙̟͔̺̣̪̜̹͓̝̙͔̲̊̽̀̋͌̐̅͋̃̊̀̐̓̓̊͋̐̈̈͆̽̅̈͒̈̽̎̂͊̏͆̔̊̔̐̀̚͠͠ͅw̷̡̨̡̨̢̡̢̡̡̡̡̡̲̖̱̪͉̬̥̫̙͉̦̤͓̞̺̝̞̣͔͚͕̙̲̲̭̯̘͇̗̥͉̣̦̘̗̤̮̼̘̰͖̱̗̦̲̭̝̬̱͈̣̬̭͖̹͙͎̻̳̗͓͓̻̞͓͈͖̤͇̗̗̥͍͎͖̥̮̘̩͎̰̤͕͙̞̃̇̋̋̄̌̐̈́̐͆̋̎͊̍͒͂͊́̎͗́́̂̂̊̈̈́̽͆̌̀̔͌͛̏̓͋̏͗̂͌̎̈́̽̐̎͆̅̄́̆̈́̿͐̏̿̌̏̀͘̕͘͘͘̚̕͘̚͘̕̚͜͜͠͝͠͝ͅͅͅ ̷̧̧̨̡̡̢̡̨̧̨̧̧̛̛̛̛̛̛̯̳͔̭̤͔͚̗̥̦̺̙͚̻͇͓͉̗͉̥̺̣̺̥͍̭̦͔͕͚͓̱̼̘̞̺͉̤̩̙̞̞̹̥̯̻̺̫̩̫̟͙̮̖̟̗̞̱̘̪̥̠̠͔̞͙͇̱͔͕̘͓̰̻̦̗̀̎͑̾́̾̍͊̔̈́̏̅̏̒̅̆́͑͋̈͊̆̽͗̃̆̈̂̑͂̒̔͛̽̔̔̈́̎̃̑̾̇̒̓̊̃͆̔̑̓̏͑̑̋̔̓̃̓́͒̉̀̈́̂́̆̅̃̾́̆̿̋͊̅͌̉̈̿͒̈́̑̓̔̽̅́̇̀̒̏͌͊̉̽̀͊̈́̊̚̕͘̚͘͘̚̕͘͘͜͜͜͝͠͠ͅm̸̧̢̡̨̨̡̧̢̧̛̛̛̺̟͓̰̰͔͚̼̘͍̦̫̼͓̺͈̱̬͔̳̺̻̻͙͍̥̹̣͖̯̫͇̝̠̥͔͓̗̱͓̪̬̟̣͚̜̮̟̹̥͈̬̦̱͖͒͛̾͂̆̎̓̉̋͐͋͑̒̎̈̍̃́̄́́̈́̓̋̈̈̋͒̈́̿̍̍̆̈̒́̾̊͆̀̓̔̌̔͛͒̿͆̌͗͆̈́̑͒͑̀̀̾̓̎̿̚̚̕͘͘͘͜͜͜͝͠͠͝͝ͅͅͅͅͅͅͅū̶̧̨̡̨̢̡̢̺̻̭͚̜̠̟̗̥̬̤̠͓̗̟̙̬̝͔̪̰͎̮̰̣̣͕͍̭̖̒́̂͛̈́̊̈́̊̓̃̕ç̶̡̨̨̨̢̢̨̡̨̢͍̜͕͉̮̙̼̦͈͇͙͙͚̮̠̬̰̜̭̼̥̺͔͇̫̫̬̻͍̭̲̲̫̣̩̣͖̺̦͔̪̞̰̫̜̺͎̫̰̩͔̮͙̬̬̝̲̦̗̬̮͍̦̯̺͔͖̥̦͙̻̫̦͍̜͖̭͓̱̞̙͚̫̱͍̜̬̻̝̲͑͊̀̈́̉̆͂̌̆̉͘͜͠͝ͅͅḣ̷̢̧̨̧̛̛̖͉͙̜̹̤̯̼̳̣̰̥͚̭͉̖̮̮̩̻̯̳͓̭͕̯̟̻̟̞͕̫͈͎̣͙͍̱͙̥̟̝͈̼̩̩͚̟̘̻͚̪̤͓͍̜̻̮̩͚͖̫̬͇̼̥̫̳̤̜̜̫̱̰̮͖̗̮̗̜͚͍͇͕̹̲̦̙͇̯̎́́̍̑̊̒̅̈́̍̔̓̉̈̈̄̀̋͒̍̀͊̽̓̓̔̈́̍̉̃̔͑̎̐͐́̃̈́̔̐̂̈̋͗̑̓̉̿̐͂͂͊̑͋̄̃̈́̈́̾͛̐̂̀̌̀́͐́̋͗͒̐͐̅̂͛̚͘̕͘̕͘͜͝͠͝͠͝͠ͅͅͅͅ ̶̨̢̡̨̧̨̨̢̛̬̱͔̠̖̖̞̙̻͕͕̬̫̯̺̤̫͈̜̣̭̟̹̙̬̰͓̥̹̘͓̼̖͔̖̘̘̺̲̦͙͕͚̖̤̮̣̳̤̮̟̙̤̺̳̟͖̳͇̮͕͕̤̙̲̮̣̣̩̱̥̹͚͎̝͉̝͇̺̗̞͖̼̀̄̆̆̓͊͐̒͑̀͒̿̈́̈́̀̉̉͂̃̍͊͒̔̚̕͝͠͠͝͝͠ͅf̸̖͖͔̞̠̮̙̹͓̞̙̼̦̮͋́̔̄͐̐̏͊̓͊̈́͆̐͗̓̋͗̎̿̈́̐̂̽̃͑̍̎̋̅̾̂̆̂̿͗̂̈͆̓̄̿̆̌̚̕͝͠ͅu̷̧̡̢̡̢̢͓̦̟̰͓̱̪͉̖̫̦̦̗̘̘̘̣̞̲̜̞̣̻͍͔̣̪̻̥̬͎̼͖̪͕̳̟͓̗͖̲͖̯͍̪̲̝̲̘̟̺͈̜̟̯̮̩̘͉̳͙̣͗̈́͜ͅͅͅr̶̡̡̡̛̼̦̟̗̝̻̟̦̞͖̝͚̗͔̳̟͚͖̫̥̣͓͊͌̊̾́̒̈́̉͒̉́̈́̌͂̅̒͗͑̈̋̉̔̂̀̕͘͝͝͝ͅt̴̨̨̢̨̢̨̧̟̞̲͙̥̙̰̹̞̘̞̪̯̟͉̪̣̖̲̭̜̣̯͍̬̪̞̻̱̲̬͎̲̹̳͎̻̪̲̫͎͇̣̭̗̯͉̰̟͔̠͙̲̜̘̼̰̗̝̰̞̜̞̙̬̩̞͎̝̥̗̙̝͖̜͇̻͖̤̮͉͉̮̱͙̬͚̮͚̖̘̥͙͈͍̥̩̎̌̌̍̇̒̉̿̒̊̌̇͆͒̄́̓̾̅͛̍̀̃͛͋̊͒͒̑̅͋̊͂̓̒̊̋̑̑͊̂͌͑̋̓̕̚̚͘̚͠͠͝͠͠͝͝ͅh̴̢̡̞̤̘͍̫̬̣̬̖̙̤̲͚̤̝̣̻̟͎͚̠̘̞͉̭̳͚̞̋́̀̂͐̃͆́̿͗̄͌͂̕͜͜͜ͅe̴̢̨̧̢̢̯̹̺͓̬̤̼̺͚̭̣̻̖̖̙̯̙͎̦̙̙̹̼͚̖̥͚͉̪̺͚͎͕̠̤̼̦̝̻͇̳̺͚̞̜̦͇̬̤̳̞̜͔̻̮̘̠̱̱͉̊́͒̑̀̌͂̋̋̅͒͑͐̀͌̍͛͛̑̑̅̈̽̾̓̈͐̈́͌̊̉́̽̓̏̅͋̈́̉̎́̽̀͑̅͐͐́̾̈́͊̓̚̕̚͜͠͝ͅr̴̨̡̧̡̡̢̨̢̛̛̛̛͇͚̩̖̱̞͇͓̦͈̠͓̰̻̠̞̞̘̩̹̮̘̼̠̭̝̝̞͇̬͚̘͔̺̳̗̯͕̘̘̺̺͚̯̩͕̦͖̬̘̮̩̭̽͑͂͌̀̀̓́̍̅̓̇̇̽͋͂͗̿̉̏̒̏͊͌͊̉̄̑̽̀͋̽́̉̅́̆̑̀̾̒̈́͐͑͊́̆̑͂̿̈́̈́̀̆̐̔̏͆̐́̿̓̆͐́̑͊͒̓̇̽̀͗̍̃͒̀̌̄̈́̕̚̕͘͘̚̚͜͜͜͝͝͝ ̷̨̧̧̧̢̢̧̨̡̨̧̢̛̛̛͉̠̬̩̜̦͇̲̟̠̪͙͇͈̝͉̖̰̫͈͙͕̣̫̗͇̲̤̻̠̼͖̤̤̜̱̫̜͎͍̹̯̘̥̫͍̙̦̩̮̣̙̝̠͉̪̰̥̬̯̼̭͎̠̱͙͓̯̞̟̖̖̤̞̼̬̮̻̘̝̞̱̜͚̥̖̗͈̫̥̤̞̺̤̮͈̣̲͙͛̍̍̄̊̀̄̄͋͋̅͐͊͗͊̓͌̑̏̆͐̑͋̆̆̒́͊̓̈́̌̒̊͛̾̓̎̑̀̓̾̉̑͌̈̐̌͗̓̋̑̈́̕̕̚̚͘͜͜͝͝͠ͅͅͅͅI̷̧̨̢̛̥̪̜͇̠͓̗̫̰̮̯̹̘͕͚̭͓̦͚̟͇̥̠̣̬͓͙̪̼̮̜͙̬̟͉͎̗̮̣̫͈̭͎̣̞͙̳͚̘̖̤̯̝̰̰̝̭̗͖͓͓̯͉̥͉̙̪̳̬̱͆͂͒̆͂̈́́͂̈́̊͛͗̒͆͑̾͆́͌͗͛͆̓̀͌̈́̃̽̊̍̂̍͊̒̃̽́͗͆͂̽͋̿͌͘͜͝͝͝͠͝ͅͅͅͅ ̷̧̧̡̨̡̡̧̨̧̡̨̛̛̛̛͓̞͚̙̼̗͉͚̻͕̲͎͎̱͖̺̱̭̪͙̯̤̝̦͇̰̞͓͈̪͙̫̮̘͖͇̲̗͍̫̱͓͇̦̤̰͇̱̲͉͍̪̟͚̘̟̯̯̦͖̙͙̘͍͇̟̜͉̠͉͈̖̰͈̞̦̏̀̍͒͛̀͑̈́́͌͊̐̎̂͐͑̍̌̒̇̒̃̋̇̓̈́̏̽̈́́͋̓̈̀̔̀̽̊̋̚̚̕͜͜͝͝͠ͅͅc̴̞̜̦͖̘̤̣̖̗̜̲̹͔̻̜̈́̋̔͂̈́̊͋̓͊̊͋̄͊͂̈͛́̾̈́͒̍́͒͆̕͘͠͠͠á̴̧̡̨̡̡̡̧̧̧͚͍̹̲̝̟̻̰̺̘͕̟͈̪͓̰̱̺̦̺̫̣̘̙͖͖̫͙̣͖͎̦͍̩̰͕̱͙̦̮͖͕̘̪͎͍̪͇̺̱̯͈̱̘̲͖͇͖͕̝̭̫͉̲̯͉̺̮͔̌͐̽̊̄͆̏͒͑̐̊̂̍͗͆̈́͗̐͌̿͌͛͘ͅņ̵̧̛̛̛̥̪̞̻͔̱̱͕̥̠͕̣̹̟̥̲̰͕̦̘̙͙͉͓͇̳̻̙̠̗̩̯͛́̈́̊́͛͐̔̌͛̾̓͗̿͂̃͑̍͋́̾̄̉͛̓͑̍̅͑̈̋͛͐̒̀̍̊́̐͊̉͌̈́͛̆͛̔͑͋̄͛̃̂̂̎͊͌̄͂̇̈́̈́͋͒̓̊̅͆̃͆͘͘̕̚͜͝͠͝͠͝͝͠͝ ̵̢̢͈̜̺̯͓̦̝̱̫̞̰̱͖̬͈͖͎̤͎̯̪̞̑̽̈́̇̄͆̀͐̊̆̆͌͘͝ͅg̴̢̨̧̧̧̨̨̨̛̥̤͖̗͎̫͚̖̩̹͙̤͖̼͇̜͉̣̱̘̙̘͇͉̱͍̮̜̪̖͎̰͈̲̙̜͍̜̪̰̱͙̼̱̻̬̣͔̺̰͖̺̼̖̲̘̝̭̟̼̬̟͙̜͎̳̙̥̲̹͚̗͕̜̺͙̯̲̯͈̠̲̞͖̻̭̬̬̞͙̰̦̱̘̩̼͖͍͚̟̳͓̼̬͈̫̞̻̀̾̇͗͗͑̂͗͊̆͗͛̀̂̔̿͐͛̾̏̍̓̋͌͛͑́̏̍͂̃̾̄͑͆̋̍̀̊̌͛͗̋̌̎́̋̇͂͛̓̈̀̇̀͂̍͂͌͆́̏͑̅̽̇̎̈́͌̓͗͐̈̓͛̆̆̆̈̉̅̈́̄̽̀͆̄̐̾̕̕͘̚̚̚̚͘͘̕͘͜͝͠͠͝ͅó̶͔͈̬̎̔̔͐̓̊̿̌̄̀́̋̓̆̆̈́̂̚͝.̶̧̛̛̛͓̯͉͈͇̖͎̘͖̤̺̗͍̫̬̜̠͔̫̼͙̤͙̥̖̳͔̮͇̬̰͆͑́̽̒̂̒͛͗̈́̂̒͆̎̀̈̃̎̒̒̂̓̋̆̈̾̇͌̔̎̄̓̄̊̅̉̀̿̈́̓̈́͑̒̌͗͑̃͗̅̀́̂̄͋̃̓̀͌͊̅̿̂̀̀̐̋̃͆͂̀̈̌͑̇̍͛̔̽̒͊͗̾͌̋̀̽̀͒̋̊̇̽̓͌̋͋͆̾̂̑̽̆̆͛̿̽̀͐̈̕̕͘̚̕̕͝͝͝͝ͅ	");
		} else {
			nameField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderName);
			emailField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderEmail);
			messageField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderMessage);
		}

		// when receiving focus, remove the placeholder text
		nameField.addEventListener('focus', (event) => {
			nameField.removeAttribute("placeholder");
		});
		emailField.addEventListener('focus', (event) => {
			emailField.removeAttribute("placeholder");
		});
		messageField.addEventListener('focus', (event) => {
			messageField.removeAttribute("placeholder");
		});

		// when losing focus, re-add the placeholder text
		nameField.addEventListener('blur', (event) => {
			nameField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderName);
		});
		emailField.addEventListener('blur', (event) => {
			emailField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderEmail);
		});
		messageField.addEventListener('blur', (event) => {
			messageField.setAttribute("placeholder", placeholderMessage);
		});
</script>